{"title":"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/12053fbfa84ee1ed600260385d3dfd3d618eb18a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{2+4+6}{1+3+5} - \\dfrac{1+3+5}{2+4+6} ?\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b73c997286092060c4c997f1c8e7edfff60217a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{36}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{7}{12}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{147}{60}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{43}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"431\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df7a3341ab06f6dee16c11539d38f7e2a20546e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{2+4+6}{1+3+5} - \\dfrac{1+3+5}{2+4+6} = \\dfrac{12}{9} - \\dfrac{9}{12} = \\dfrac{4}{3} - \\dfrac{3}{4} = \\boxed{\\dfrac{7}{12}\\; \\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"429\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><br />\nNote: This exact problem was reused in 2013 AMC 10B: \n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bkRNTz2IJE8\">https://youtu.be/bkRNTz2IJE8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbod